@startuml a05-l2-integration-adapters
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Building Block View — Level 2: Whitebox "Integration Adapters"

package "Integration Adapters (whitebox) — app/Services/" {
  [AIService\ntranscribe(audioPath)\nchat(system, user, temp)] as ai
  [GitHubService\ncreateIssue(title, body, labels)] as gh
}

' Level-1 neighbours of this whitebox
rectangle "Web Edge (L1)" as edge #EEEEEE
rectangle "Domain Services (L1)\nPreprocessingService" as domain #EEEEEE
file "config/herold.php\nopenai.api_key · github.token\ngithub.owner · github.repo" as cfg

cloud "OpenAI\nTranscription API\nPOST /v1/audio/transcriptions" as whisper
cloud "OpenAI\nChat Completion API\nPOST /v1/chat/completions" as chat
cloud "GitHub\nIssues API\nPOST /repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues" as issues

edge --> ai : transcribe()\n[UC-06]
domain --> ai : chat()\n[UC-06]
edge --> gh : createIssue()\n[UC-08]
ai ..> cfg : Bearer credential\n(fail-fast if unset)
gh ..> cfg : PAT + repo target\n(fail-fast if unset)
ai --> whisper : HTTPS multipart,\ntimeout 120 s (NB-02)
ai --> chat : HTTPS JSON,\njson_object mode (NB-03)
gh --> issues : HTTPS JSON, PAT,\nAPI version 2022-11-28,\ntimeout 30 s (NB-04)

note bottom of ai
  Both adapters use Laravel's ""Http"" facade —
  no vendor SDK. One logical seam per neighbour
  (NB-02, NB-03, NB-04); AIService bundles two
  seams in one class — refined in Level 3 (§ 5.3.1).
end note

@enduml
